  "solution": {
    "text": "For a thin lens,<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mi>m</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi>v</mi><mi>f</mi></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math><br />From the above equation, slope of the line is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>f</mi></mfrac></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>c</mi><mi>b</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>f</mi></mfrac></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>b</mi><mi>c</mi></mfrac></math>",
